@startuml Transfer-Flow
!theme plain
title VaultGuard RWA - Token Transfer Flow with Preflight

actor Investor
participant "Frontend" as FE
participant "BFF" as BFF
participant "Backend API" as API
participant "Blockchain" as Chain
participant "T-REX Token" as Token
participant "Identity Registry" as IR
participant "Modular Compliance" as MC

== Transfer Request ==

Investor -> FE: Enter recipient + amount
FE -> FE: Debounce (500ms)

== Preflight Check (Advisory) ==

FE -> BFF: POST /api/backend/assets/{id}/transfer/preflight
activate BFF
BFF -> API: POST /api/assets/{id}/transfer/preflight\n+ Bearer token\n+ X-Investor-Wallet
activate API

API -> API: Check sender KYC:\n- status=APPROVED\n- onChainVerified=true

API -> API: Check recipient eligibility:\n- Registered wallet?\n- Compliance status?

API -> Chain: staticcall canTransfer(sender, recipient, amount)
activate Chain
Chain -> IR: isVerified(sender)
Chain -> IR: isVerified(recipient)
Chain -> MC: Check compliance modules:\n- Pause state\n- Max balance\n- Transfer limits
Chain --> API: true | false + reason
deactivate Chain

API --> BFF: Preflight result
deactivate API
BFF --> FE: Preflight result
deactivate BFF

alt Preflight Failed
  FE -> Investor: Show error:\n- Recipient not compliant\n- Amount exceeds limit\n- Token paused\n- Wrong network
  note right: Never prompt wallet\nsignature on failed preflight
else Preflight Passed

  == Final Refresh Before Signature ==

  FE -> BFF: GET /api/backend/assets/{id}/transfer/preflight (refresh)
  BFF -> API: Re-check (may have changed)
  API -> Chain: staticcall canTransfer again
  Chain --> API: Still valid
  API --> BFF: Confirmed
  BFF --> FE: Proceed

  == Wallet Signature ==

  FE -> Investor: Prompt MetaMask signature
  Investor -> FE: Sign transaction

  FE -> Chain: Send signed tx to RPC
  activate Chain

  == On-Chain Execution (Final Authority) ==

  Chain -> Token: transfer(recipient, amount)
  activate Token
  Token -> MC: canTransfer(sender, recipient, amount)
  activate MC
  MC -> IR: isVerified(sender)
  MC -> IR: isVerified(recipient)
  MC -> MC: Check all modules
  MC --> Token: true | revert
  deactivate MC

  alt On-Chain Check Passes
    Token -> Token: Update balances
    Token --> Chain: Transfer success
    deactivate Token
    Chain --> FE: Receipt + confirmation
    deactivate Chain
    FE -> Investor: ✅ Transfer complete

    FE -> BFF: Log transaction (optional)
    BFF -> API: POST /api/audit/transaction
    API -> API: Record audit event

  else On-Chain Check Fails
    Token --> Chain: Revert with reason
    deactivate Token
    Chain --> FE: Transaction failed
    deactivate Chain
    FE -> Investor: ❌ Transfer rejected:\n- Recipient lost compliance\n- Token was paused\n- Compliance rule changed
  end

end

note over FE, Chain
Key Principles:
- Preflight is advisory
- Refresh before signature
- On-chain hooks are final
- Never skip preflight
- Show clear error messages
end note

@enduml
</ADR>
